& [HonestySecurityIdentityBoundaryIntegrityMilestone] identifies the higher-order guard semantics
  @ [source] C:\Project\Cantor\source_documents\2026-08-03_honesty_security_identity_boundary_integrity\Dictated_Honesty_Security_Identity_Boundary_Integrity_Source.sop
