  + [behavior] material boundary delta emits a proof-carrying signal, holds affected authority and effects, loads contracts, and invokes separate faculty judgments
  + [operating_contract] facts remain distinct from explicit assumptions whose dependencies, invalidation, expiry, consequence, and fallback are tracked
  + [accommodation] known broken state may be used only through bounded degraded operation and cannot be represented as intact
  + [reconstitution] recovery forms a new enclosing identity boundary preserving predecessor, breach, invariant, and residual lineage
  + [trust] the new contract defines acceptance conditions while passing those conditions earns provisional, qualified, or admitted trust within exact scope
  + [stability_standard] predecessor protections plus breach-derived violation tests, monitoring, response, and non-regression govern future stability
  + [implementation_result] is none
  + [schedule_effect] HSIBI-SJS-01 now includes BOAC-001 through BOAC-019 and CIFP-SLICE-02 remains blocked
  + [next] multi-authority audit before canonical contract, signal, trust-state, or runtime forms

